        <mxCell id="phase1" value="&lt;b&gt;HeteroGraph Builder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Builds PyG HeteroData&lt;br&gt;3 Nodes: Task (39-dim), Res (6), Shift (5)&lt;br&gt;3 Edges: precedes, uses, Constrained By&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c9daf8;strokeColor=#3b78d8;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=18;" parent="1" vertex="1">
